{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>But as I live.</b> This is an expression of an oath, and it did not specify what the oath is, but rather said: ״וימלא כבוד ה' את כל הארץ״ — that is, if I act so that My name is not profaned among the nations, to say 'from lack of HaShem's ability' — for in the end I will give them the land. But this I will do to them: ״אם יראו את הארץ״ etc."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:25.624115832Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}